type: software
title: "obd_can_bridge — standalone OBD-II bridge on ESP32-S3"
abstract: "Standalone OBD-II diagnostic bridge on ESP32-S3 with built-in WiFi web interface. MCP2515 driven by raw SPI registers, ISO 15765-4 29-bit, live PIDs, no external library."
